internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-75-
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-76-// ExecuteWrapperRestore runs the §4.2 after-restore sequence to its
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-77-// decided effects:
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-78-//
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-79-//  1. read the latest locally known lease (CurrentLease);
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-80-//  2. attempt the mesh lease refresh under the measured bound (a
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-81-//     missing, failed, or timed-out attempt falls back to local
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-82-//     knowledge, unverified — never verified, never blocking
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-83-//     forever);
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-84-//  3. decide through the landed wrapper owner over the ordered
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-85-//     winner (local win plus valid materialization resumes);
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-86-//  4. offer remote attach/takeover when another host owns the session
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-87-//     in an interactive terminal;
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-88-//  5. park without launching the provider in all other cases.
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-89-//
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-90-// Only the launch and reattach decisions execute the backend restore,
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-91-// and only bound to the decided winner: the restore authorization
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-92-// must carry the ordered (lease_id, lease_epoch), so a refreshed
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-93-// winner for one lease never authorizes effects under another
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-94-// lease's grant. The offer, park, and refuse decisions return with
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-95-// no backend operation, no tmux exec, and no provider. Union-rival
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-96-// ambiguity is not modeled here (bound B38): the entry decides over
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-97-// the single refreshed or local winner, and a refresh adapter that
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-98-// observes rivals must surface them as refresh failure so the entry
internal/tmuxserver/wrapper.go-99-// parks unverified.
