### Revision 3 — exhaustive custody mode oracle and same-client serialization

Pinned authority is SPEC v0.7.0 §3.2, lines 806–813. The current implementation
compares its four custody predicates with an independent oracle for all 4096
Unix low-12-bit modes at all three production entries: 49,152 of 49,152
component × mode × entry inputs matched. The 12 named subtests are the four
component classes (socket leaf, runtime tmux directory, root, ancestor) times
ServerProber.Probe, ServerSpawner.Spawn, and Lifecycle.Execute.

