| ownerOnlyCustodyRootMode | root | Lifecycle.Execute | TestCustodyModeOracleAtProductionEntries/root/Execute | N-root-mask-drop-group-triplet, N-root-mask-drop-other-triplet, six N-root-mask-drop-* single-bit rows, N-root-admit-0750 |
