+`D-attach-entry-deadline-shadowed` is supplementary and is not counted as a
+measured narrowing: the earlier wait bound refuses the same deadline instant
+before admission, so the entry fast-fail arm stays shadowed. Its bound owner is
+the `Lifecycle.Execute` wait/admission boundary and its adjacent effective
+gates are `N-attach-postlock-deadline` and `N-attach-wait-deadline`.
+`C-control` is the intended line-count-preserving neutral survivor, showing the
+harness reports a no-behavior-change control as SURVIVED.
