-|---|---|---|---|
-| `N-socket-mask-drop-other-triplet` | `permissions&0o077` → `permissions&0o070`, admitting other-only socket modes | `TestCustodyPermissionSocketLeafExactModes` | KILLED; 0602/0604/0606 fail at all three entries. |
